sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Contract as Contract
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Contract: markVoided(reason)
    Note over Contract: Policies: contractRead, contractWrite, contractExecute
    Note over Contract: Guards (2)
    Contract->>Contract: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;sent#quot; or self.status == #quot;viewed#quot;
    Contract->>Contract: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Contract->>Contract: mutate.status
    Contract->>Contract: mutate.voidReason
    Contract->>Contract: mutate.voidedAt
    Contract->>EventBus: emit ContractVoided on contract.voided
    Contract-->>-Client: void